<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Bank unaudited 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Bank unaudited 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for</p>
<p>the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		20.72     vs	    19.68</p>
<p>    Net		   20,746.93     vs	19,701.92</p>
<p>NOTE: Bangkok Bank Plc is Thailand's largest bank in terms of assets.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
